# Ajani Unrelenting: "Whenever you activate a loyalty ability, create a 2/2 colorless Wizard Soldier creature token named Cadet."
# It is any planeswalker's loyalty ability, by its controller, and no other ability. On turn 2 Bot2 casts Ajani Resolute and
# activates his 0: nothing happens for Bot1 (the battlefield stays four permanents: Ajani Unrelenting and three Moxen). On turn 3
# Bot1 casts Figure of Destiny and activates its {R/W} ability, an activated ability that is not a loyalty ability: no Cadet. On
# turn 5 Bot1 casts his own Ajani Resolute (casting a planeswalker is not activating it) and activates the 0, which is not one of
# Unrelenting's abilities, and a Cadet appears (the positive control).

